(
    title: "Commando",
    description: Some("Activision\'s late-era port of Capcom\'s run-and-gun: as Super Joe you push up the battlefield with an endless assault rifle and a pocketful of grenades, the throwables clearing obstacles and knots of enemies that the rifle cannot. One of the last big-label Activision carts for the 2600, arriving in 1988 well after the arcade original."),
